{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Inflation uprate the \u00a312570 Personal Allowance in April 2027 or earlier",
        "additional_details": "",
        "background": "As we all know the personal allowance has been frozen at \u00a312570 since 2021 and it is currently planned to remain that way until 2031. We call on the UK government to inflation uprate it at least once in April 2027 or earlier to give the tax-payer a 'cost of living' breather.",
